DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44653::$$$message_0386_0000_0000$$$::"We're here. This is the home base of whoever summoned us."::
44654::$$$message_0386_0000_0001$$$::"It has an atmosphere as ominous as Yamotsu Hirasaka. [wvl canskip=false time=250][hffgchg2 chara=キャスターext face=驚き pos=right time=300 twno=1]...That crater is filled with mounds of corpses."::
44655::$$$message_0386_0000_0002$$$::"Whatever the cause of all this is, it shouldn't exist in this world. Let's send it back to the afterlife."::
44656::$$$message_0386_0000_0003$$$::"And then, we can go back to the Moon Cell, where Maestro awaits!"::
44658::$$$message_0386_0000_0005$$$::"...What a noisy bunch. I don't recognize these Servants. Are these the guests you invited, Manaka?"::
44659::$$$message_0386_0000_0006$$$::"Yeah. Sorry, Sakura. I tried to summon Saber, but I pulled the wrong one."::
44660::$$$message_0386_0000_0007$$$::"And some extras came with her. I left them alone because it was a hassle to deal with them, but now they're here. Hehe. Someone's got a lot of free time."::
44661::$$$message_0386_0000_0008$$$::"Wha[line len=2]"::
44662::$$$message_0386_0000_0009$$$::"That's the person who summoned us? Is she a zombie? There's clearly a gaping hole in her chest."::
44663::$$$message_0386_0000_0010$$$::"...Who are you people, anyway? This is the space between Zero and Proto. A wonderland where the character system has collapsed."::
44664::$$$message_0386_0000_0011$$$::"If you don't belong to either, then you should disappear. This world completely belongs to us."::
44665::$$$message_0386_0000_0012$$$::"Is that...Sakura? That's awful... She's fully linked to the Greater Grail. The past and future are completely muddled..."::
44666::$$$message_0386_0000_0013$$$::"That's right. I'm a dark loli. A heroine who's fallen into despair at being stuck as a boss character, who will return everything to the void."::
44667::$$$message_0386_0000_0014$$$::"Ms. Blossom, then. You're cuter than the Sakura we know, but I can see you share the same roots."::
44668::$$$message_0386_0000_0015$$$::"Don't get ahead of yourself, Sakura! This won't solve anything! [wvl][hfwww layer=1]Calm down, and step away from that girl who keeps twirling around!"::
44669::$$$message_0386_0000_0016$$$::"It's okay, Archer. The Greater Grail taught me that my character alignment can never change. [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=小桜 face=呆 pos=left time=300 twno=1]My destiny is total darkness."::
44670::$$$message_0386_0000_0017$$$::"...I didn't come here with any regrets or wishes, but I formed a unit with Aika since we were both already here. [wvl canskip=false time=200]Go ahead, Aika."::
44671::$$$message_0386_0000_0018$$$::"La la la [whitestar] massacre [humming] Hehehe[whitestar] Fresh meat[humming] I'll kill yaaa, zombie[humming] Spin, Greater Grail[humming]"::
44672::$$$message_0386_0000_0019$$$::"Aika, you need to get over the fact that a prince took your little sister away."::
44673::$$$message_0386_0000_0020$$$::"Sisters are meant to kill one another. To a big sister, the younger sister is a snake. To the little sister, the older sister is a demon. You need to understand that."::
44674::$$$message_0386_0000_0021$$$::"Hehehe. You're so well put together, Sakura. [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=愛歌 face=楽 pos=right time=400 twno=1]But I don't have a little sister. I don't even know what family is."::
44675::$$$message_0386_0000_0022$$$::"But... Oh, I know. I can sense that you're a little sister. Why don't we kill each other once we activate the Greater Grail?"::
44676::$$$message_0386_0000_0023$$$::"..."::
44677::$$$message_0386_0000_0024$$$::"Aw, you look so sad, Sakura. That's adorable! [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=愛歌 face=邪悪 pos=right time=300 twno=1][hfwww layer=1]But don't worry. We'll return all the other creatures to dust, first."::
44678::$$$message_0386_0000_0025$$$::"I'm the princess of the surface. You're the princess of the underground. Let's reach a fair compromise?"::
44679::$$$message_0386_0000_0026$$$::"Hnngh...!"::
44680::$$$message_0386_0000_0027$$$::"Wow... Sakura's already too far gone, but that other girl's on a different level."::
44681::$$$message_0386_0000_0028$$$::"That's a genuine embodiment of humanity's evil. If left unchecked, she'll undoubtedly take root in this parallel world and fill it with flowers."::
44682::$$$message_0386_0000_0029$$$::"It seems that way. I'm sorry, Sakura, but we're going to defeat you here!"::
44683::$$$message_0386_0000_0030$$$::"Hehehe. Try, if you think you can. I'm used to being cut to ribbons."::
44685::$$$message_0386_0000_0032$$$::"What a monster... Let's go, Saber! That Aika girl is an enemy of all mankind, a being of extraordinary scale!"::
44686::$$$message_0386_0000_0033$$$::"I completely agree! I didn't think she'd be this bad! She fits my tastes perfectly!"::
44687::$$$message_0386_0000_0034$$$::"Ehehehe... [playstop time=800 storage=bgm12.ogg][wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=愛歌 face=ジト目 pos=right time=400 twno=1]What?"::
44688::$$$message_0386_0000_0035$$$::"It would be such a waste to kill you! Let's not send you to the afterlife! I'll cherish you as one of my maids!"::
44689::$$$message_0386_0000_0036$$$::"If your brains are a little lacking, we'll just give you a strict education! Don't worry, I'm a genius at all things! I'll shape you into an upstanding human being!"::
44690::$$$message_0386_0000_0037$$$::"Now, open, Golden Theatre! Add that beautiful waifu to my harem!"::
44691::$$$message_0386_0000_0038$$$::"No way... Is she overwriting my Potnia Theron!?"::
44692::$$$message_0386_0000_0039$$$::"Umu! You belong to me, now! I won't let you get away. Heh... Keke, hehehe!"::
44693::$$$message_0386_0000_0040$$$::"Um, Sakura? Would you do your big sister a favor?"::
44694::$$$message_0386_0000_0041$$$::"I really can't deal with people like that, so can I leave? Actually, let me out of here. She's even more of a pervert than I am!"::
44695::$$$message_0386_0000_0042$$$::"Request declined. I wish you two perverts a long and happy life together."::

